OL,3,GNEWSARail strike to cause disruption to
OL,4,Aservices
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reduced rail timetable will be in
OL,7,Fplace across parts of the West Midlands
OL,8,Fdue to planned industrial action
OL,9,Faffecting Chiltern Railways services.
OL,11,FTrain managers, who are members of the
OL,12,FRMT union, will take part in a 24-hour
OL,13,Fstrike on Thursday in an ongoing
OL,14,Fdispute over staffing arrangements on
OL,15,Fthe proposed East West Rail route.
OL,17,FServices to and from
OL,18,FStratford-upon-Avon, Leamington Spa and
OL,19,FBirmingham Moor Street will be
OL,20,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
