OL,3,GNEWSARail strike to cause disruption to
OL,4,Aservices
OL,5,
OL,6,FTony Baxter, interim managing director
OL,7,Fof Chiltern Railways, said the company
OL,8,Fwas "disappointed" by the industrial
OL,9,Faction but expected to run "the vast
OL,10,Fmajority of our services on that day".
